<title>USA: St Paul hogs steady/up $1.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul hogs steady/up $1.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows &amp; Gilts: Compared to Tuesday, small supply $1.00 to $1.50 higher. Top $52.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3     220-250 lbs     52.50</p>
<p>	     250-260 lbs     52.00-52.50</p>
<p>	     260-270 lbs     51.00-52.00</p>
<p>Sows: Steady. Top 55.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3     300-400 lbs     44.00</p>
<p>	     400-500 lbs     45.00-48.00</p>
<p>	     500-550 lbs     51.00</p>
<p>	     550-700 lbs     53.00-54.00, package 55.00</p>
<p>Boars:     300-700 lbs     42.00</p>
</text>
